# Scene 2 — "The histogram is an instrument" (~70 s)
# Beats: output distribution live while dragging; the image renders once, on
# release; sky-patch neutral black; GHS with SP on the mode.
# MANUAL moments (presenter): drag the D slider in GHS; press M -> identity
# in Asinh; hover the ADJUST - ALL CHANNELS header.
open cygnus-dentelles-TS80.xisf
waitloaded
sleep 2000
autostf
sleep 3000
# drag the white point: the OUTPUT histogram tracks live, the frame renders
# on release (say it: sixty megapixels, one render, from the final position)
histdrag w -220
sleep 2500
histdrag b 60
sleep 2500
action undo
sleep 1500
# neutral black from a sky patch (bottom-left corner is empty sky here):
# three black points jump to the three channel medians in one gesture
blackpatch 40 1800 120 120
sleep 3500
# GHS on top of the balanced windows, symmetry point snapped to the mode
fn ghs
sleep 1500
axis peak
sleep 3000
